# SELECT ALL INVADERS (セレクト・オール・インベーダー) - vocal score
# Synth2 score notation: notes are PITCH DURATION LYRIC; '+' = next syllable of the word, '[ph ph]' = phonemes.
# Every section is placed with '@ <beat>' (bar k starts at beat 4*(k-1)); '|' marks bar lines.
# Chords and sections: SPEC.md. Lyrics: lyrics.md.
# examples/select_all_invaders/vocals.py derives the AI Double, the Harmony, Crowd 2 / Crowd 3
# and the aliens' "fan voice" chop from these tracks (apply_vocal_production).
title: Select All Invaders
tempo: 168
time: 4/4
key: A minor

